{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinhead Adventures is the first game from Neversold Studios. ver. 0.6.X<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/cc987af382010b34cfdf7ba2b54177b8.webp?t=1764256395\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br>Pinhead Adventures is a 3D Action Adventure Platformer like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash Land on, and explore mysterious planets as Pinhead and Orbo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, solve puzzles, run away, and fight to lure Zortan back for the final battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collectathon has begun with a physics based sandbox! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Coins to Explosive Barrels, Boxes to Puzzle Pieces, anything not nailed down is physics based! You can even use stuff as a cudgel in a pinch! Even books! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately you won't have time to read in this coin stacking, bunny hopping, barrel blasting Pinhead Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is different, with each level having assortments of objectives that can be pre completed or awaiting your puzzle solving skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand crafted levels taking advantage of the Pinhead's unique gravity defying characteristics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you find?<br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cowboy hat's to Space suits, customize your Pinhead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furnish your ship, or leave it bare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbo is your best friend. A portable checkpoint, Inventory, and a loyal pal all in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't loose your hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.0 is coming soon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Major Patch 0.6.X </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in this Pinhead Adventure! Play Today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2882840?t=1764256395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/48135e1edec219a882c64cc7d4ef4790e45cc51b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764256395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/6b8a32a3bc82aa225dbd5c5becf49b4ae6d18c4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764256395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/6b8a32a3bc82aa225dbd5c5becf49b4ae6d18c4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764256395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3578680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinhead Adventures is the first game from Neversold Studios. ver. 0.6.X<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/cc987af382010b34cfdf7ba2b54177b8.webp?t=1764256395\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br>Pinhead Adventures is a 3D Action Adventure Platformer like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash Land on, and explore mysterious planets as Pinhead and Orbo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, solve puzzles, run away, and fight to lure Zortan back for the final battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collectathon has begun with a physics based sandbox! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Coins to Explosive Barrels, Boxes to Puzzle Pieces, anything not nailed down is physics based! You can even use stuff as a cudgel in a pinch! Even books! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately you won't have time to read in this coin stacking, bunny hopping, barrel blasting Pinhead Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough is different, with each level having assortments of objectives that can be pre completed or awaiting your puzzle solving skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand crafted levels taking advantage of the Pinhead's unique gravity defying characteristics! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you find?<br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cowboy hat's to Space suits, customize your Pinhead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furnish your ship, or leave it bare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbo is your best friend. A portable checkpoint, Inventory, and a loyal pal all in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't loose your hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.0 is coming soon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Major Patch 0.6.X </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in this Pinhead Adventure! Play Today!</p>","developers":["Neversold"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/1bb1e61f94852f67f1c3fe38604d49defe6e3bd9/header.jpg?t=1764256395","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2882840/1045236431/0cd663aec210ac267ee945b30bc22ef6126809ed/1750982143/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750986708","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2882840/1045236431/0cd663aec210ac267ee945b30bc22ef6126809ed/1750982143/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750986708","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2882840/1045236431/0cd663aec210ac267ee945b30bc22ef6126809ed/1750982143/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750986708","id":257162106,"name":"Zortan's Return Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162106/436ef53ffe5cfff7090250a18742f2e6081d06aa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750986708"}